  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:anything",
    "edge:search>anything",
    "focus:anything"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "在网上，几乎能搜到任何东西。任何，加上东西："
    },
    {
     "en": "any"
    },
    {
     "en": "thing"
    },
    {
     "en": "anything"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:nothing",
    "edge:search>nothing",
    "focus:nothing"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "有时候，什么也找不到。没有，加上东西："
    },
    {
     "en": "no"
    },
    {
     "en": "thing"
    },
    {
     "en": "nothing"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:agree",
    "edge:internet>agree",
    "focus:agree"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "网上大家会讨论。同意，英语是"
    },
    {
     "en": "agree"
    },
    {
     "en": "I agree with you."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:agreement",
    "edge:agree>agreement",
    "focus:agreement"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "加上 m e n t，就是意见一致、协议："
    },
    {
     "en": "agreement"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:disagree",
    "edge:internet>disagree",
    "focus:disagree"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "不同意，前面加 d i s："
    },
    {
     "en": "disagree"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:disagreement",
    "edge:disagree>disagreement",
    "focus:disagreement"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "意见不一样，就是分歧："
    },
